(4013798, 573447, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''ve come back to this several times.  I really like the use of neg space. I''m just wondering if maybe the texture of the ground to the left is not a touch too dark. I''d maybe dodge it to make it look more like the area beneath the bird. I love his feet!!!!  Nicely focused.</td>', 'I''ve come back to this several times.  I really like the use of neg space. I''m just wondering if maybe the texture of the ground to the left is not a touch too dark. I''d maybe dodge it to make it look more like the area beneath the bird. I love his feet!!!!  Nicely focused.', '2007-08-20 09:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4013802, 574112, 15711, '<td valign="top">Cranes and herons are always so poised looking to me. Their elegance is a joy to watch. I like that there are two in the shot - kind of creates an almost romantic sense.  I like the undulating line of the shore too. Bumping up.</td>', 'Cranes and herons are always so poised looking to me. Their elegance is a joy to watch. I like that there are two in the shot - kind of creates an almost romantic sense.  I like the undulating line of the shore too. Bumping up.', '2007-08-20 09:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4013805, 573548, 15711, '<td valign="top">At first glance, you just think the crocodile is a rock in the water.  Not that it matters, but I''d have given it a totally different title. Well spotted and captured.</td>', 'At first glance, you just think the crocodile is a rock in the water.  Not that it matters, but I''d have given it a totally different title. Well spotted and captured.', '2007-08-20 09:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
