(4013811, 573315, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is really lovely.  Perfectly lit and focused. I like that you left a touch of the pier in the lower left so that the overall line of the shot is horizontal.  Nice one! Bumping up.</td>', 'This is really lovely.  Perfectly lit and focused. I like that you left a touch of the pier in the lower left so that the overall line of the shot is horizontal.  Nice one! Bumping up.', '2007-08-20 09:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
