(4013818, 573905, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has a nice delicate feel to it.I might''ve cropped it in a panoramic shape and deleted part of the back and foreground.</td>', 'This has a nice delicate feel to it.I might''ve cropped it in a panoramic shape and deleted part of the back and foreground.', '2007-08-20 09:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
