(4014116, 572274, 76430, '<td valign="top">It looks very static with the boy just lying there and not actually "coming in for a landing".  If the boy showed some movement, like with splashing and an excited look on his face, it would improve it a lot.  I like the arcs of water, which do show movement.  If you had other kids standing by laughing it would help also.</td>', 'It looks very static with the boy just lying there and not actually "coming in for a landing".  If the boy showed some movement, like with splashing and an excited look on his face, it would improve it a lot.  I like the arcs of water, which do show movement.  If you had other kids standing by laughing it would help also.', '2007-08-20 11:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
