(4015790, 574223, 25355, '<td valign="top">Well, that''s a thought of a different colour. ;-Þ I''m not too keen on the tiltedness of it, though.</td>', 'Well, that''s a thought of a different colour. ;-Þ I''m not too keen on the tiltedness of it, though.', '2007-08-20 22:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
