(4015820, 573918, 34659, '<td valign="top">The border really helps this shot.  The whites are a little strong - losing a bit of detail, but I really like the lines &amp; shapes of composition and the background tones.</td>', 'The border really helps this shot.  The whites are a little strong - losing a bit of detail, but I really like the lines & shapes of composition and the background tones.', '2007-08-20 22:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
