(4015836, 572689, 34659, '<td valign="top">Don''t know how you managed to get this angle/POV, but it is appealing.  I like the blues too.  The image may be a tad on the dark side, but other than that I really like it.</td>', 'Don''t know how you managed to get this angle/POV, but it is appealing.  I like the blues too.  The image may be a tad on the dark side, but other than that I really like it.', '2007-08-20 22:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4015838, 573009, 34659, '<td valign="top">Clean simple lines and colors.  Good focus too.  The lighter background area in the lower right is a little distracting, but otherwise nice work.</td>', 'Clean simple lines and colors.  Good focus too.  The lighter background area in the lower right is a little distracting, but otherwise nice work.', '2007-08-20 22:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
