(4017348, 573816, 54446, '<td valign="top">Wow, I searched and searched, but could find no wings, either figuratively, or literally.... only an artistically blurred aspen scene.  I believe in allowing great latitude in challenge interpretation, but I think it''s a stretch to see or imagine "wings" in this scene.  I''ll admit I may not get your message.  Hope it''s okay with you to offer these words of constructive criticism.  Nice visual treat, though!</td>', 'Wow, I searched and searched, but could find no wings, either figuratively, or literally.... only an artistically blurred aspen scene.  I believe in allowing great latitude in challenge interpretation, but I think it''s a stretch to see or imagine "wings" in this scene.  I''ll admit I may not get your message.  Hope it''s okay with you to offer these words of constructive criticism.  Nice visual treat, though!', '2007-08-21 13:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
