(4017391, 572844, 67258, '<td valign="top">A good idea for the challenge, but I feel there is more you could have done to enhanced the photo.  The background is unappealing, and provides a strange context for the belly-dancer - if this was part of a display and you had no opportunity to move your model, opting for a very shallow depth of field may have helped to blur and disguise the background.</td>', 'A good idea for the challenge, but I feel there is more you could have done to enhanced the photo.  The background is unappealing, and provides a strange context for the belly-dancer - if this was part of a display and you had no opportunity to move your model, opting for a very shallow depth of field may have helped to blur and disguise the background.', '2007-08-21 14:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
