(4017941, 572287, 64795, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, but I think having the fly body in the image almost detracts from the picture.  Having the body in the frame makes everything look out of focus even though a portion of the wing is in nice focus.</td>', 'Interesting composition, but I think having the fly body in the image almost detracts from the picture.  Having the body in the frame makes everything look out of focus even though a portion of the wing is in nice focus.', '2007-08-21 17:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
