(4019909, 573878, 50034, '<td valign="top">Great pan!  Acceptable focus on a nice DOF!  However, sadly we both know that nothing in striking focus with cost you points, but difficulty of capture...certainly gains you admiration points from me.  I would be curious to see a re-DO of this photo, if you duped the layer, set on High-Pass filter (in Other...Filter Pull-Down in PS Elements,) set on 10.0, and re-set on Overlay.  (Just a new sharpening trick I learned from the current Shutterbug magazine.)</td>', 'Great pan!  Acceptable focus on a nice DOF!  However, sadly we both know that nothing in striking focus with cost you points, but difficulty of capture...certainly gains you admiration points from me.  I would be curious to see a re-DO of this photo, if you duped the layer, set on High-Pass filter (in Other...Filter Pull-Down in PS Elements,) set on 10.0, and re-set on Overlay.  (Just a new sharpening trick I learned from the current Shutterbug magazine.)', '2007-08-22 07:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
