(4023038, 572573, 55201, '<td valign="top">Looks like you dropped this angel into the woods but she does not look like she belongs there.  Her edges are too sharp, colors too bright, perspective of the foilage is off and you do not have her looking at anything in particular. Family and friends will like it so do not hit the delete key.</td>', 'Looks like you dropped this angel into the woods but she does not look like she belongs there.  Her edges are too sharp, colors too bright, perspective of the foilage is off and you do not have her looking at anything in particular. Family and friends will like it so do not hit the delete key.', '2007-08-23 01:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
