(4023314, 573315, 47852, '<td valign="top">I like that you''ve chosen to leave just a bit of the wood where he was taking off from.  Makes it more of a story of an event instead of just a bird flying in mid air, yet it''s subtle and doesn''t detract from the main focus.  Very nicely done!</td>', 'I like that you''ve chosen to leave just a bit of the wood where he was taking off from.  Makes it more of a story of an event instead of just a bird flying in mid air, yet it''s subtle and doesn''t detract from the main focus.  Very nicely done!', '2007-08-23 04:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4023315, 573996, 47852, '<td valign="top">Wow... what a busy little guy!  Great macro... wish the wings were just a bit more of the focal point in the context of this particular challenge, but such a great shot that it hardly seems to matter.</td>', 'Wow... what a busy little guy!  Great macro... wish the wings were just a bit more of the focal point in the context of this particular challenge, but such a great shot that it hardly seems to matter.', '2007-08-23 04:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
