(4025563, 574331, 72714, '<td valign="top">Love the bright colours against the dark background! I think more realistic wings would have made the whole image much better though.</td>', 'Love the bright colours against the dark background! I think more realistic wings would have made the whole image much better though.', '2007-08-24 07:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025565, 572628, 72714, '<td valign="top">I love the out of focus petals in the background and the bright colours. The fly is also well placed and nicely photographed. Only one small gripe, the shadow cast by the fly is a bit strong.</td>', 'I love the out of focus petals in the background and the bright colours. The fly is also well placed and nicely photographed. Only one small gripe, the shadow cast by the fly is a bit strong.', '2007-08-24 07:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025568, 571297, 72714, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot! I love the softness in the background and the way you have managed to catch the birds eye so clearly. Gives him a rather far away, dreamy expression. Poor thing though, wonder what happened to his little foot!</td>', 'Excellent shot! I love the softness in the background and the way you have managed to catch the birds eye so clearly. Gives him a rather far away, dreamy expression. Poor thing though, wonder what happened to his little foot!', '2007-08-24 07:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025575, 574063, 72714, '<td valign="top">A really well caught shot but I would guess you have changed the background which makes the bird almost seem like a cardboard cutout. There''s a kind of purple edge all the way round the bird. I would also like to have seen more colour saturation on his feathers.</td>', 'A really well caught shot but I would guess you have changed the background which makes the bird almost seem like a cardboard cutout. There''s a kind of purple edge all the way round the bird. I would also like to have seen more colour saturation on his feathers.', '2007-08-24 07:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025577, 574104, 72714, '<td valign="top">Good colour saturation and composition.</td>', 'Good colour saturation and composition.', '2007-08-24 07:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
