(4025586, 574055, 72714, '<td valign="top">OMG, I didn''t see the bear till I read the name. That''s so good!</td>', 'OMG, I didn''t see the bear till I read the name. That''s so good!', '2007-08-24 07:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025590, 573315, 72714, '<td valign="top">Wonderful picture with nice detail in the white feathers. The sky is a great contrast. I know this type of photo is really difficult to plan but considering your background is so clear and therefore easy to work with, what about cutting out the slice of sky between the bird and the wooden perch to narrow the distance between them and then extending the sky in front of the bird to give it more space to fly into. If you try an edit like this, I would love to see it!</td>', 'Wonderful picture with nice detail in the white feathers. The sky is a great contrast. I know this type of photo is really difficult to plan but considering your background is so clear and therefore easy to work with, what about cutting out the slice of sky between the bird and the wooden perch to narrow the distance between them and then extending the sky in front of the bird to give it more space to fly into. If you try an edit like this, I would love to see it!', '2007-08-24 07:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025591, 573882, 72714, '<td valign="top">Lovely! It looks like the wing is covered with thousands of tiny crystals. I like the narrow depth of field too!</td>', 'Lovely! It looks like the wing is covered with thousands of tiny crystals. I like the narrow depth of field too!', '2007-08-24 07:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025592, 573985, 72714, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours and I like the inclusion of the sidewalk on the left. It gives the photo more depth. Maybe just remove the tin can from the bottom corner. Is it a tin can?</td>', 'Lovely colours and I like the inclusion of the sidewalk on the left. It gives the photo more depth. Maybe just remove the tin can from the bottom corner. Is it a tin can?', '2007-08-24 07:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025593, 573040, 72714, '<td valign="top">Great placement in the frame and I love the way the wingtips curl.</td>', 'Great placement in the frame and I love the way the wingtips curl.', '2007-08-24 07:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025595, 572652, 72714, '<td valign="top">Wonderful soft background and crystal clear foreground. I like the saturation and the way you have caught the bird with it''s wings out and also looking to the side so that you can see detail in his face. Well done.</td>', 'Wonderful soft background and crystal clear foreground. I like the saturation and the way you have caught the bird with it''s wings out and also looking to the side so that you can see detail in his face. Well done.', '2007-08-24 07:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025597, 573829, 72714, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful and peaceful, almost dreamlike. The water was also still enough to give a wonderful reflection. Well done!</td>', 'This is so beautiful and peaceful, almost dreamlike. The water was also still enough to give a wonderful reflection. Well done!', '2007-08-24 07:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025602, 573717, 72714, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! I love the movement in the skirt and her hair. I think the shot would have been improved though if her body had been facing in the same direction but with her head turned towards the camera, looking over her left shoulder, just enough for us to see the side of her face. Not being able to see her face and have something to ''focus'' on makes me, as the viewer, feel a little disconnected from the photo. Does that make sense? :-)</td>', 'Gorgeous! I love the movement in the skirt and her hair. I think the shot would have been improved though if her body had been facing in the same direction but with her head turned towards the camera, looking over her left shoulder, just enough for us to see the side of her face. Not being able to see her face and have something to ''focus'' on makes me, as the viewer, feel a little disconnected from the photo. Does that make sense? :-)', '2007-08-24 07:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025604, 574125, 72714, '<td valign="top">I love the pastel background and the focus on the large insect. I also like the way you have divided the picture into triangles with the tree. Unfortunately, the colours on the smaller insect are such a contrast to the rest of the image, that it looks almost like a cartoon image cut from a comic book. I would prefer the photo without the addition of the ''attacker''.</td>', 'I love the pastel background and the focus on the large insect. I also like the way you have divided the picture into triangles with the tree. Unfortunately, the colours on the smaller insect are such a contrast to the rest of the image, that it looks almost like a cartoon image cut from a comic book. I would prefer the photo without the addition of the ''attacker''.', '2007-08-24 08:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025605, 572640, 53316, '<td valign="top">10. Love love LOVE the glow in the background. Composition and contrast great as well.</td>', '10. Love love LOVE the glow in the background. Composition and contrast great as well.', '2007-08-24 08:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
