(4025639, 573882, 53316, '<td valign="top">Wow.......  10 10 10!!!<br/> <br/>edit: Okay, I had a dream that some really awful (bad quality) photo won the blue, and I was SO annoyed that "Fallen" hadn''t won!  ... so yes, I think that tells you how much I like this photo, LOL!</td>', 'Wow.......  10 10 10!!! edit: Okay, I had a dream that some really awful (bad quality) photo won the blue, and I was SO annoyed that "Fallen" hadn''t won!  ... so yes, I think that tells you how much I like this photo, LOL!', '2007-08-24 08:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025640, 574055, 53316, '<td valign="top">Like the creativity!</td>', 'Like the creativity!', '2007-08-24 08:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025641, 574332, 72714, '<td valign="top">Oh poor little thing! Likes like a survivor of Hurricane Dean! Great irridiscent colours and I love the uncluttered, pastel background.</td>', 'Oh poor little thing! Likes like a survivor of Hurricane Dean! Great irridiscent colours and I love the uncluttered, pastel background.', '2007-08-24 08:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025642, 572402, 53316, '<td valign="top">10 - very very dramatic, I love it! And the "fly" just gives it that final touch.</td>', '10 - very very dramatic, I love it! And the "fly" just gives it that final touch.', '2007-08-24 08:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025644, 572984, 53316, '<td valign="top">AHHHHHHHHHHhhh this is FANTASTIC. 10!!!</td>', 'AHHHHHHHHHHhhh this is FANTASTIC. 10!!!', '2007-08-24 08:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025646, 572723, 53316, '<td valign="top">10! Love it. Very moody and horor-filmish.</td>', '10! Love it. Very moody and horor-filmish.', '2007-08-24 08:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025647, 572573, 53316, '<td valign="top">10! Just darling.</td>', '10! Just darling.', '2007-08-24 08:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025648, 574328, 53316, '<td valign="top">10.  Amazing. I first thought of the moth as a doll and the black curled parts being its hair - had to look again to see the moth, actually!</td>', '10.  Amazing. I first thought of the moth as a doll and the black curled parts being its hair - had to look again to see the moth, actually!', '2007-08-24 08:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025649, 574332, 53316, '<td valign="top">Really neat. Don''t see photos like this everyday. 9.</td>', 'Really neat. Don''t see photos like this everyday. 9.', '2007-08-24 08:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025651, 574234, 53316, '<td valign="top">9. I love the pensive feel to this.</td>', '9. I love the pensive feel to this.', '2007-08-24 08:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025653, 574112, 72714, '<td valign="top">The highlights seem a bit bright but I like the way the shoreline angles from corner to corner and you caught a perfect take off! (Or is it a landing?) I like the overall sharpness of the bird with just the wingtips blurred to show the motion.</td>', 'The highlights seem a bit bright but I like the way the shoreline angles from corner to corner and you caught a perfect take off! (Or is it a landing?) I like the overall sharpness of the bird with just the wingtips blurred to show the motion.', '2007-08-24 08:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025655, 572288, 53316, '<td valign="top">9. Just amazing colors and composition. Would have prefered the whites to be a bit whiter.</td>', '9. Just amazing colors and composition. Would have prefered the whites to be a bit whiter.', '2007-08-24 08:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025658, 571877, 72714, '<td valign="top">Well caught! If this is longjump, I hope you weren''t close enought to land up with sand in your face! I love the facial expression! Concentration and determination, even in mid flight!</td>', 'Well caught! If this is longjump, I hope you weren''t close enought to land up with sand in your face! I love the facial expression! Concentration and determination, even in mid flight!', '2007-08-24 08:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025662, 573250, 72714, '<td valign="top">I love this shot! It brings back memories of childhood dreams! Wonderful silhouette!</td>', 'I love this shot! It brings back memories of childhood dreams! Wonderful silhouette!', '2007-08-24 08:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025664, 573386, 72714, '<td valign="top">Awesome! The orange against the green background is really striking!</td>', 'Awesome! The orange against the green background is really striking!', '2007-08-24 08:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025668, 572402, 72714, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition! I could feel the jet ''looming'' over me!</td>', 'Wonderful composition! I could feel the jet ''looming'' over me!', '2007-08-24 08:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025671, 573429, 72714, '<td valign="top">I felt the crop was a little tight on this photo but I love the corner to corner composition and the wonderful colours.</td>', 'I felt the crop was a little tight on this photo but I love the corner to corner composition and the wonderful colours.', '2007-08-24 08:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025673, 574039, 72714, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a little harsh, resulting in blown out hightlights. The angle of lighting is good though, adding depth to the image.</td>', 'The lighting is a little harsh, resulting in blown out hightlights. The angle of lighting is good though, adding depth to the image.', '2007-08-24 08:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025678, 571814, 72714, '<td valign="top">Oh wow! Awesome colours and very well timed! Maybe just remove the shadow of the beak on his wing so that the flash lighting is not so obvious. This photo has a wonderful tropical island feel!</td>', 'Oh wow! Awesome colours and very well timed! Maybe just remove the shadow of the beak on his wing so that the flash lighting is not so obvious. This photo has a wonderful tropical island feel!', '2007-08-24 08:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025813, 573008, 51269, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot- ten!</td>', 'Amazing shot- ten!', '2007-08-24 10:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025819, 574063, 51269, '<td valign="top">These little gems certainly fit this challenge ! Ten</td>', 'These little gems certainly fit this challenge ! Ten', '2007-08-24 10:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025921, 571858, 61222, '<td valign="top">Love this image!! Wonderful detail and lighting.</td>', 'Love this image!! Wonderful detail and lighting.', '2007-08-24 11:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025923, 573866, 61222, '<td valign="top">Great capture.</td>', 'Great capture.', '2007-08-24 11:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025925, 572287, 61222, '<td valign="top">Great macro</td>', 'Great macro', '2007-08-24 11:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025935, 573218, 61222, '<td valign="top">WOW this is a beautiful capture.</td>', 'WOW this is a beautiful capture.', '2007-08-24 11:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025938, 574019, 67343, '<td valign="top">Great capture love the whited out back ground really make the birds pop. :)</td>', 'Great capture love the whited out back ground really make the birds pop. :)', '2007-08-24 12:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025944, 572844, 35994, '<td valign="top">A different take on the challenge, I like the idea, the cars in the background are a little distracting (I''m guessing she was in a parade or something so you couldn''t exactly choose your background....). I''m interested to read the comments for this after the challenge to see what she was dressed up for.</td>', 'A different take on the challenge, I like the idea, the cars in the background are a little distracting (I''m guessing she was in a parade or something so you couldn''t exactly choose your background....). I''m interested to read the comments for this after the challenge to see what she was dressed up for.', '2007-08-24 12:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025945, 572984, 35994, '<td valign="top">Neat shot! I really like the b&amp;w for this.</td>', 'Neat shot! I really like the b&w for this.', '2007-08-24 12:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025946, 572803, 35994, '<td valign="top">Nice patterned flowers.</td>', 'Nice patterned flowers.', '2007-08-24 12:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025948, 573864, 35994, '<td valign="top">I like the crop you used &amp; the b&amp;w.</td>', 'I like the crop you used & the b&w.', '2007-08-24 12:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025951, 573705, 35994, '<td valign="top">Negative image huh? Pretty neat, I thought it was a night shot.</td>', 'Negative image huh? Pretty neat, I thought it was a night shot.', '2007-08-24 12:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025955, 573878, 35994, '<td valign="top">Neat action shot.</td>', 'Neat action shot.', '2007-08-24 12:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025956, 573023, 35994, '<td valign="top">Nice pose! I like the graffitied walls.</td>', 'Nice pose! I like the graffitied walls.', '2007-08-24 12:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025958, 573855, 35994, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like a painting, I like the effect on the flowers.</td>', 'Almost looks like a painting, I like the effect on the flowers.', '2007-08-24 12:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025959, 572287, 35994, '<td valign="top">Nice gold tones.</td>', 'Nice gold tones.', '2007-08-24 12:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025960, 574049, 35994, '<td valign="top">Nice closeup.</td>', 'Nice closeup.', '2007-08-24 12:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025963, 574309, 35994, '<td valign="top">I find the blur a little distracting since the background seems to be in focus. Just my 2 cents.</td>', 'I find the blur a little distracting since the background seems to be in focus. Just my 2 cents.', '2007-08-24 12:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025970, 572811, 35994, '<td valign="top">Man I hope there''s water down below!!</td>', 'Man I hope there''s water down below!!', '2007-08-24 12:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025971, 573985, 35994, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.</td>', 'Nice colors.', '2007-08-24 12:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025976, 574070, 35994, '<td valign="top">Nice smoke! Pretty neat how you can see the heat or fumes (whichever) coming up infront of the crowd.</td>', 'Nice smoke! Pretty neat how you can see the heat or fumes (whichever) coming up infront of the crowd.', '2007-08-24 12:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025979, 572575, 35994, '<td valign="top">Nice colors on the hammock.</td>', 'Nice colors on the hammock.', '2007-08-24 12:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4025981, 573974, 35994, '<td valign="top">I like the gold &amp; red tones.</td>', 'I like the gold & red tones.', '2007-08-24 12:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026037, 571131, 61222, '<td valign="top">Beautiful love the composition of this and colors</td>', 'Beautiful love the composition of this and colors', '2007-08-24 12:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026039, 573008, 16241, '<td valign="top">excellent, hands down this should win.</td>', 'excellent, hands down this should win.', '2007-08-24 12:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026319, 573748, 78196, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. The centered composition works brilliantly.</td>', 'Wonderful. The centered composition works brilliantly.', '2007-08-24 14:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026328, 574332, 78196, '<td valign="top">Wow. Very different to your standard dragonfly shot. There''s something quite sad about seeing these wings in decay. If I have one criticism it''s that the blue body seems a little too bright, perhaps this could have been toned down a bit? Overall I love the shot.</td>', 'Wow. Very different to your standard dragonfly shot. There''s something quite sad about seeing these wings in decay. If I have one criticism it''s that the blue body seems a little too bright, perhaps this could have been toned down a bit? Overall I love the shot.', '2007-08-24 14:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026331, 574260, 78196, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully shot - the supreme inelegance of the gull''s position is highlighted by the wing flapping resulting from you judicious choice of shutter speed. Like the title too.</td>', 'Wonderfully shot - the supreme inelegance of the gull''s position is highlighted by the wing flapping resulting from you judicious choice of shutter speed. Like the title too.', '2007-08-24 14:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026335, 573447, 78196, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Superb composition and daring use of negative space.</td>', 'Beautiful. Superb composition and daring use of negative space.', '2007-08-24 14:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026336, 574277, 78196, '<td valign="top">Super. As someone who''s done a fair about of flying themselves that looks like a bit of a dangerously steep climb angle!</td>', 'Super. As someone who''s done a fair about of flying themselves that looks like a bit of a dangerously steep climb angle!', '2007-08-24 14:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026337, 574326, 78196, '<td valign="top">Great capture but a bit noisy and not enough sharpness.</td>', 'Great capture but a bit noisy and not enough sharpness.', '2007-08-24 14:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026343, 571847, 78196, '<td valign="top">Really excellent use of negative space.</td>', 'Really excellent use of negative space.', '2007-08-24 14:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026344, 571814, 78196, '<td valign="top">A superb capture and an unusual posture from the hummingbird. The background is nicely colourful but seems out of place in comparison with the bird. It''s obvious you''ve used a flash here (I can''t imagine you had much choice!) but I wonder whether under advanced editing you could have softened the rather harsh whiteness?</td>', 'A superb capture and an unusual posture from the hummingbird. The background is nicely colourful but seems out of place in comparison with the bird. It''s obvious you''ve used a flash here (I can''t imagine you had much choice!) but I wonder whether under advanced editing you could have softened the rather harsh whiteness?', '2007-08-24 14:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026348, 573594, 78196, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting on the subject but the shot is let down by the background either side. If you had taken this from a lower perspective with just the sky in the background we would lose something of her expression but gain a superior composition overall.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting on the subject but the shot is let down by the background either side. If you had taken this from a lower perspective with just the sky in the background we would lose something of her expression but gain a superior composition overall.', '2007-08-24 14:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026349, 573530, 78196, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of colour and composition. One of my favourite insect shots, and there are plenty to choose from!</td>', 'Excellent use of colour and composition. One of my favourite insect shots, and there are plenty to choose from!', '2007-08-24 14:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026363, 574183, 78196, '<td valign="top">Incredibly sharp and with beautiful colours. One of my very favourites.</td>', 'Incredibly sharp and with beautiful colours. One of my very favourites.', '2007-08-24 14:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026367, 572689, 78196, '<td valign="top">An excellent shot sadly let down by jaggies and noise artifacts - I''d be careful about what you use in post-processing and how you use it.</td>', 'An excellent shot sadly let down by jaggies and noise artifacts - I''d be careful about what you use in post-processing and how you use it.', '2007-08-24 14:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026385, 574234, 35994, '<td valign="top">The magic sorceress huh? Neat!</td>', 'The magic sorceress huh? Neat!', '2007-08-24 15:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026386, 574274, 35994, '<td valign="top">I like the background, it really makes the feather stand out.</td>', 'I like the background, it really makes the feather stand out.', '2007-08-24 15:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026388, 573891, 35994, '<td valign="top">Such bright colors! What a pretty bird</td>', 'Such bright colors! What a pretty bird', '2007-08-24 15:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026390, 573812, 35994, '<td valign="top">Isn''t it funny how they all flock together?</td>', 'Isn''t it funny how they all flock together?', '2007-08-24 15:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026393, 574069, 35994, '<td valign="top">I like the pattern of the bulidings &amp; the colors are really nice.</td>', 'I like the pattern of the bulidings & the colors are really nice.', '2007-08-24 15:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026394, 573517, 35994, '<td valign="top">Nice clouds!</td>', 'Nice clouds!', '2007-08-24 15:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026395, 572197, 35994, '<td valign="top">I like the selective desaturation/sepia tones.</td>', 'I like the selective desaturation/sepia tones.', '2007-08-24 15:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026398, 574133, 35994, '<td valign="top">Nice jet lines &amp; clarity.</td>', 'Nice jet lines & clarity.', '2007-08-24 15:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026401, 573926, 35994, '<td valign="top">I like the softness of the picture, nice capture.</td>', 'I like the softness of the picture, nice capture.', '2007-08-24 15:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026402, 574012, 35994, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset! I like the siloette effect.</td>', 'Beautiful sunset! I like the siloette effect.', '2007-08-24 15:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026403, 574055, 35994, '<td valign="top">What a view! Nice puffy clouds :)</td>', 'What a view! Nice puffy clouds :)', '2007-08-24 15:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026405, 573895, 35994, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity, looks like he has his eye on something.</td>', 'Nice clarity, looks like he has his eye on something.', '2007-08-24 15:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026407, 574011, 35994, '<td valign="top">I wish they were just a little clearer so I could tell what they were exactly. Nice old looking building, I like the tones.</td>', 'I wish they were just a little clearer so I could tell what they were exactly. Nice old looking building, I like the tones.', '2007-08-24 15:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026409, 574165, 35994, '<td valign="top">For some reason this almost reminds me of something from E.T. Neat shot.</td>', 'For some reason this almost reminds me of something from E.T. Neat shot.', '2007-08-24 15:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026410, 573674, 35994, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting! I like the b&amp;w.</td>', 'Nice lighting! I like the b&w.', '2007-08-24 15:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026411, 574076, 35994, '<td valign="top">Really nice bright colors, I like the crop &amp; border.</td>', 'Really nice bright colors, I like the crop & border.', '2007-08-24 15:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026413, 574313, 35994, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! I like how you incorporated teh city into the shot.</td>', 'Nice shot! I like how you incorporated teh city into the shot.', '2007-08-24 15:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026414, 573711, 35994, '<td valign="top">That almost looks like an ice figure or something, neat.</td>', 'That almost looks like an ice figure or something, neat.', '2007-08-24 15:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026417, 571433, 35994, '<td valign="top">Cute pink outfit!</td>', 'Cute pink outfit!', '2007-08-24 15:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026418, 571131, 35994, '<td valign="top">Love the textures you caught, very nice.</td>', 'Love the textures you caught, very nice.', '2007-08-24 15:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026429, 573748, 35994, '<td valign="top">Nice stop motion!</td>', 'Nice stop motion!', '2007-08-24 15:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026431, 573781, 35994, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot! I love the green background and the detail on his wings is excellent!</td>', 'Awesome shot! I love the green background and the detail on his wings is excellent!', '2007-08-24 15:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026440, 573758, 35994, '<td valign="top">IMO the lighting by her neck is a little harsh, I really like the concept though.</td>', 'IMO the lighting by her neck is a little harsh, I really like the concept though.', '2007-08-24 15:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026441, 574060, 35994, '<td valign="top">What a bright little throat he has!</td>', 'What a bright little throat he has!', '2007-08-24 15:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026443, 573436, 35994, '<td valign="top">Nice painting.</td>', 'Nice painting.', '2007-08-24 15:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026447, 573871, 35994, '<td valign="top">IMO I like the desaturated part better, it almost makes his suit (in color) not seem white. Great shot though.</td>', 'IMO I like the desaturated part better, it almost makes his suit (in color) not seem white. Great shot though.', '2007-08-24 15:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026449, 571877, 35994, '<td valign="top">JuMp! Looks like she was going for the long one here neat angle.</td>', 'JuMp! Looks like she was going for the long one here neat angle.', '2007-08-24 15:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026461, 574041, 72714, '<td valign="top">Awesome scenery and well captured. Love the saturated colours.</td>', 'Awesome scenery and well captured. Love the saturated colours.', '2007-08-24 15:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026465, 572288, 72714, '<td valign="top">Nice and clear and I like the fact that the colours are almost monotone. Looking a bit deeper :-) to me the spread wings represent a longing for freedom yet the out of focus bars tell us that this will never become a reality. A very thought provoking image.</td>', 'Nice and clear and I like the fact that the colours are almost monotone. Looking a bit deeper :-) to me the spread wings represent a longing for freedom yet the out of focus bars tell us that this will never become a reality. A very thought provoking image.', '2007-08-24 15:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026466, 574068, 72714, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture of an insect in it''s natural habitat. Maybe the hotspots on the wings could be toned down slightly though.</td>', 'Lovely capture of an insect in it''s natural habitat. Maybe the hotspots on the wings could be toned down slightly though.', '2007-08-24 15:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026471, 573976, 72714, '<td valign="top">I like the angle and background you have chosen.</td>', 'I like the angle and background you have chosen.', '2007-08-24 15:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026474, 573926, 72714, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! It''s like a painting! I love the motion in the wings and the space you have left on the right hand side.</td>', 'Beautiful! It''s like a painting! I love the motion in the wings and the space you have left on the right hand side.', '2007-08-24 15:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026476, 573436, 72714, '<td valign="top">I''m not too keen on photographs of flat art but I like the way you have cropped this.</td>', 'I''m not too keen on photographs of flat art but I like the way you have cropped this.', '2007-08-24 15:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026477, 574018, 72714, '<td valign="top">I love the way the birds are lined up. What a pity the one at the back did not oblige by lifting his head so that it was visible.</td>', 'I love the way the birds are lined up. What a pity the one at the back did not oblige by lifting his head so that it was visible.', '2007-08-24 15:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026479, 573864, 72714, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting and I like the crop you have chosen.</td>', 'Lovely lighting and I like the crop you have chosen.', '2007-08-24 15:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026482, 573787, 72714, '<td valign="top">OMG! I almost feel like I am being accused of something aweful! This image conveys loads of emotion through the eye contact with the photographer/viewer. Brilliant colours and clarity. Well captured.</td>', 'OMG! I almost feel like I am being accused of something aweful! This image conveys loads of emotion through the eye contact with the photographer/viewer. Brilliant colours and clarity. Well captured.', '2007-08-24 15:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026483, 573837, 72714, '<td valign="top">A gorgeous black &amp; white. I love the mood.</td>', 'A gorgeous black & white. I love the mood.', '2007-08-24 15:51:42.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4026485, 573748, 72714, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture and lovely soft background which makes the bird really stand out.</td>', 'Excellent capture and lovely soft background which makes the bird really stand out.', '2007-08-24 15:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026491, 572575, 72714, '<td valign="top">Bat-woman? This image makes me feel really strange, I keep wanting to turn my head upside down which disturbs me a bit.</td>', 'Bat-woman? This image makes me feel really strange, I keep wanting to turn my head upside down which disturbs me a bit.', '2007-08-24 15:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026493, 572805, 72714, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately this image has a lot of noise and the focus and clarity are not good at all. A very difficult shot to try and capture and well done for trying.</td>', 'Unfortunately this image has a lot of noise and the focus and clarity are not good at all. A very difficult shot to try and capture and well done for trying.', '2007-08-24 15:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026495, 573980, 72714, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colours and really unusual subject. I''ve never seen one of these before. I like the way you have thrown the background out of focus too.</td>', 'Wonderful colours and really unusual subject. I''ve never seen one of these before. I like the way you have thrown the background out of focus too.', '2007-08-24 15:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026498, 573816, 72714, '<td valign="top">Ohhhh, my favourite type of photograph. Loads of movement and a very painterly effect. Great colour saturation too. I love it.</td>', 'Ohhhh, my favourite type of photograph. Loads of movement and a very painterly effect. Great colour saturation too. I love it.', '2007-08-24 15:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026499, 572254, 72714, '<td valign="top">Good capture and lovely clear background. I like the way the bird is looking in your direction too.</td>', 'Good capture and lovely clear background. I like the way the bird is looking in your direction too.', '2007-08-24 15:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026500, 574151, 72714, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! This would have done well in backlighting too! I love the rug which imitates the softness of the wings and the babies hair. Too cute!</td>', 'Beautiful! This would have done well in backlighting too! I love the rug which imitates the softness of the wings and the babies hair. Too cute!', '2007-08-24 16:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
