(4026845, 573758, 72714, '<td valign="top">A lovely shot! I like the drama of the B&amp;W and the flare created by the light. Also a nice take on the subject of Wings. This would have done well in the backlighting challenge as well.</td>', 'A lovely shot! I like the drama of the B&W and the flare created by the light. Also a nice take on the subject of Wings. This would have done well in the backlighting challenge as well.', '2007-08-24 18:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
