(4026848, 573880, 72714, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is such an unusual shot. I like the movement in the wings and the colour of the flower that tones with the colour of the bird. I feel the background is a bit distracting though and this photo would have benefited from a shallower depth of field to blur the background and make the bird really stand out.</td>', 'Wow, this is such an unusual shot. I like the movement in the wings and the colour of the flower that tones with the colour of the bird. I feel the background is a bit distracting though and this photo would have benefited from a shallower depth of field to blur the background and make the bird really stand out.', '2007-08-24 18:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026849, 573905, 72714, '<td valign="top">Great dreamy shot. The wings look beautiful and you caught the swan just at the right time before it''s neck was sliced in two by the horizon. Well done.</td>', 'Great dreamy shot. The wings look beautiful and you caught the swan just at the right time before it''s neck was sliced in two by the horizon. Well done.', '2007-08-24 18:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
