(4027946, 573926, 82534, '<td valign="top">Great pose of the gull.  The wings are a bit soft and during the conversion to black and white, it seems they blend in with the gray sky a bit more than is desirable.  Still, very good image which perfectly fits the challenge.</td>', 'Great pose of the gull.  The wings are a bit soft and during the conversion to black and white, it seems they blend in with the gray sky a bit more than is desirable.  Still, very good image which perfectly fits the challenge.', '2007-08-25 09:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4027947, 573512, 82534, '<td valign="top">The dreamlike quality of this photo is really appealing.</td>', 'The dreamlike quality of this photo is really appealing.', '2007-08-25 09:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4028025, 572723, 32754, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture of these bats, are they fruit bats?  I love the tones of the image; they look happy napping up there.</td>', 'Awesome capture of these bats, are they fruit bats?  I love the tones of the image; they look happy napping up there.', '2007-08-25 11:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4028031, 574070, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this.  Great capture of the heat and smoke.</td>', 'I like the composition of this.  Great capture of the heat and smoke.', '2007-08-25 11:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4028032, 573218, 32754, '<td valign="top">I like the symmetry and unusual angle of these wings...</td>', 'I like the symmetry and unusual angle of these wings...', '2007-08-25 11:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4028033, 573218, 67697, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture of the wings.  Too bad the head was not turned to the side to get the completeness of the swan.  I''ve never seen wings do that before.  Very pretty with the lighting.</td>', 'Beautiful capture of the wings.  Too bad the head was not turned to the side to get the completeness of the swan.  I''ve never seen wings do that before.  Very pretty with the lighting.', '2007-08-25 11:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4028034, 571877, 67697, '<td valign="top">Nice stop motion.  Too bad the hand or wing tip? :)got cut off on the right.</td>', 'Nice stop motion.  Too bad the hand or wing tip? :)got cut off on the right.', '2007-08-25 11:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4028037, 573871, 67697, '<td valign="top">This looks like a photo for a musical group.  I understand that you were trying to highlight the groom, but something seems off with the desat - not very complementary to the groomsmen.  I''d have left it in color because I bet this is a really good pic that stands out on its own.</td>', 'This looks like a photo for a musical group.  I understand that you were trying to highlight the groom, but something seems off with the desat - not very complementary to the groomsmen.  I''d have left it in color because I bet this is a really good pic that stands out on its own.', '2007-08-25 11:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4028040, 573556, 67697, '<td valign="top">Nice use of symmetry. Love the blue sky.</td>', 'Nice use of symmetry. Love the blue sky.', '2007-08-25 11:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4028043, 573548, 67697, '<td valign="top">Lol at first I thought that was a bunch of rocks in the background.  Good capture.</td>', 'Lol at first I thought that was a bunch of rocks in the background.  Good capture.', '2007-08-25 11:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4028045, 574151, 67697, '<td valign="top">Cutie!  Love the lighting.</td>', 'Cutie!  Love the lighting.', '2007-08-25 11:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4028047, 574055, 67697, '<td valign="top">I probably would not have seen that if your title did not mention it.  Good imagination!</td>', 'I probably would not have seen that if your title did not mention it.  Good imagination!', '2007-08-25 11:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4028051, 573841, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like that it looks like the cotton candy lady is watching them.  Not a very busy fair!  And now I want a lemon tree too lol.</td>', 'I like that it looks like the cotton candy lady is watching them.  Not a very busy fair!  And now I want a lemon tree too lol.', '2007-08-25 11:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4028055, 572984, 67697, '<td valign="top">Oh it really would have been cool if you had caught her a split second earlier.  Now it''s just discarded wings lol.</td>', 'Oh it really would have been cool if you had caught her a split second earlier.  Now it''s just discarded wings lol.', '2007-08-25 11:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4028059, 573837, 67697, '<td valign="top">Love the gothic feel of the pic.</td>', 'Love the gothic feel of the pic.', '2007-08-25 11:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4028062, 574328, 67697, '<td valign="top">Oooh dark and eerie.  Looks like some kind of monster.</td>', 'Oooh dark and eerie.  Looks like some kind of monster.', '2007-08-25 11:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4028064, 572066, 67697, '<td valign="top">Eww is that real?  I like the use of a black background for this.</td>', 'Eww is that real?  I like the use of a black background for this.', '2007-08-25 11:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4028066, 573218, 80588, '<td valign="top">This is SO beautiful! I wish the wings could have formed a little heart right there in the center! Almost!<br/>:O)</td>', 'This is SO beautiful! I wish the wings could have formed a little heart right there in the center! Almost!:O)', '2007-08-25 11:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4028068, 574011, 67697, '<td valign="top">lol looks like paper airplanes.  Hope you have a description - i''d like to find out what these are.  I like the light and shadows.</td>', 'lol looks like paper airplanes.  Hope you have a description - i''d like to find out what these are.  I like the light and shadows.', '2007-08-25 11:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4028070, 571297, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like that it''s face is personified.  And the look says it is not bothered at all by the loss of a leg.  Great catch!</td>', 'I like that it''s face is personified.  And the look says it is not bothered at all by the loss of a leg.  Great catch!', '2007-08-25 11:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4028072, 571814, 67697, '<td valign="top">Great catch!  Looks almost like it is falling.</td>', 'Great catch!  Looks almost like it is falling.', '2007-08-25 11:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4028082, 572647, 80588, '<td valign="top">The bokeh is PERFECT! LOVELY shot!</td>', 'The bokeh is PERFECT! LOVELY shot!', '2007-08-25 11:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4028083, 573008, 80588, '<td valign="top">Amazing capture!</td>', 'Amazing capture!', '2007-08-25 11:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4028084, 571297, 80588, '<td valign="top">I came back to look at this...is one of his feet missing? Awwwww! I originally gave this a score of 7 and wanted to come back and give it an 8. Can a score be changed after it''s been made? My 8 didn''t seem to register.<br/>Great shot!<br/> <br/> <br/>I got my 8 to show!</td>', 'I came back to look at this...is one of his feet missing? Awwwww! I originally gave this a score of 7 and wanted to come back and give it an 8. Can a score be changed after it''s been made? My 8 didn''t seem to register.Great shot!  I got my 8 to show!', '2007-08-25 11:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4028369, 573058, 57882, '<td valign="top">Magnificant detail and color.  Nice capture.</td>', 'Magnificant detail and color.  Nice capture.', '2007-08-25 15:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4028379, 573489, 66201, '<td valign="top">I actually really like this concept - and the B+W...just about everything: except that her feet look so awkward....something not quite picturesque about them: typical ballet pointed toes might have been more appealing. I think I would have given this a 10 if not for those feet...they almost turn the image into something of the burlesque - a kind of parody of "flying", which is a shame because this might have been genuinely beautiful.</td>', 'I actually really like this concept - and the B+W...just about everything: except that her feet look so awkward....something not quite picturesque about them: typical ballet pointed toes might have been more appealing. I think I would have given this a 10 if not for those feet...they almost turn the image into something of the burlesque - a kind of parody of "flying", which is a shame because this might have been genuinely beautiful.', '2007-08-25 15:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4028382, 573447, 66201, '<td valign="top">I have come back to this again and have decided that I really do like the blown out space....making this a "negative space" image. The bird is clear and the detail to the left of the image is lovely. Love those outstretched toes.</td>', 'I have come back to this again and have decided that I really do like the blown out space....making this a "negative space" image. The bird is clear and the detail to the left of the image is lovely. Love those outstretched toes.', '2007-08-25 15:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4028383, 571717, 66201, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bird and so clearly captured.</td>', 'Beautiful bird and so clearly captured.', '2007-08-25 15:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4028386, 573218, 66201, '<td valign="top">Coming back to bump to 10 - the BEST in the challenge! The HDR feel is just gorgeous and the unconventional view of the bird just presents so powerfully the "Wings" idea. What a great capture. Your title just brings it all together: Anna Pavlova would have been smitten!</td>', 'Coming back to bump to 10 - the BEST in the challenge! The HDR feel is just gorgeous and the unconventional view of the bird just presents so powerfully the "Wings" idea. What a great capture. Your title just brings it all together: Anna Pavlova would have been smitten!', '2007-08-25 15:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
