(4031615, 572640, 66384, '<td valign="top">This looks like an illustration for a fairy tale. Now you have to write the story. I love how the magical goose leave a wake of sparkling fairy dust with the flap of it''s wings. It seems to have transformed the daisies as it passed by. I like the b&amp;w for this image.</td>', 'This looks like an illustration for a fairy tale. Now you have to write the story. I love how the magical goose leave a wake of sparkling fairy dust with the flap of it''s wings. It seems to have transformed the daisies as it passed by. I like the b&w for this image.', '2007-08-27 02:10:54.000000', NULL, 0),
