(4031627, 574331, 28742, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Rugman:</b></div><hr/><i>Not expecting much, just seeing how overall site accepts. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Glad your expectations were not overestimated. ;-) Really I don''t think the idea was bad, but to pull off a good finish with a concept like that, you have to make it pop and it has to be relatively flawless. Realistic wings and the can against a real sky maybe. Tough one to pull of but don''t give up on thinking outside the box. I''m glad to see something other than a fairy, hummingbird or dragonfly. :)</td>', 'Originally posted by Rugman:Not expecting much, just seeing how overall site accepts.  Glad your expectations were not overestimated. ;-) Really I don''t think the idea was bad, but to pull off a good finish with a concept like that, you have to make it pop and it has to be relatively flawless. Realistic wings and the can against a real sky maybe. Tough one to pull of but don''t give up on thinking outside the box. I''m glad to see something other than a fairy, hummingbird or dragonfly. :)', '2007-08-27 02:17:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4031631, 573812, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed. I''m impressed that you were able to do this without cropping. It is so hard to compose a shot when the subjects are in constant motion. It''s fun looking at this picture because there is something different going on with each bird. They are such individuals. And I like the overall flow and layers of the images.</td>', 'Nicely composed. I''m impressed that you were able to do this without cropping. It is so hard to compose a shot when the subjects are in constant motion. It''s fun looking at this picture because there is something different going on with each bird. They are such individuals. And I like the overall flow and layers of the images.', '2007-08-27 02:19:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4031633, 573787, 20608, '<td valign="top">Bloody hell mate... what a great picture, I didn''t get this far in voting but it would be an instant 8-9 incredibly sharp<br/> <br/>Congrats on 12th dude, our team look in good form.</td>', 'Bloody hell mate... what a great picture, I didn''t get this far in voting but it would be an instant 8-9 incredibly sharp Congrats on 12th dude, our team look in good form.', '2007-08-27 02:20:27.000000', NULL, 0),
