(4032365, 571847, 66353, '<td valign="top">Should have placed much higher imho. I ad it in my top 10 - and that''s where I believe it deserves to be.<br/>Highly underrated...!</td>', 'Should have placed much higher imho. I ad it in my top 10 - and that''s where I believe it deserves to be.Highly underrated...!', '2007-08-27 11:13:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4032401, 574151, 74605, '<td valign="top">Nice work Alicia!  Your little angle is exactly that, a darling little angle.  Your capture here is very nice! I love the look on his face!</td>', 'Nice work Alicia!  Your little angle is exactly that, a darling little angle.  Your capture here is very nice! I love the look on his face!', '2007-08-27 11:42:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4032413, 574068, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is a marvelous shot. The iridescence is beautiful, and I like the little pearls in their little compartments. The geometry is very nice, and I am fascinated by the little hands at work. I am guessing that the score was lower than deserved because the voters were concentrating on the wings. To me they really are not the main focus of the shot, but if wings are being judged, they are a little blown in the highlights and a little soft in the focus.</td>', 'This is a marvelous shot. The iridescence is beautiful, and I like the little pearls in their little compartments. The geometry is very nice, and I am fascinated by the little hands at work. I am guessing that the score was lower than deserved because the voters were concentrating on the wings. To me they really are not the main focus of the shot, but if wings are being judged, they are a little blown in the highlights and a little soft in the focus.', '2007-08-27 11:47:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4032419, 571858, 66952, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, beautiful, beautiful!!! Besides being perfect for the challenge, the lighting and detail are perfect.<br/> <br/>eta....Not only did you win the challenge with no 1-4 scores, you got a Posthumous 10, too. It''s like pitching a no hitter!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-08-27 10:53:24.</i></td>', 'Beautiful, beautiful, beautiful!!! Besides being perfect for the challenge, the lighting and detail are perfect. eta....Not only did you win the challenge with no 1-4 scores, you got a Posthumous 10, too. It''s like pitching a no hitter!', '2007-08-27 11:51:58.000000', '2007-08-27 11:53:24.000000', 0),
(4032427, 574328, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is the sort of image I could hang on my wall, in very large format, and never get tired of looking at it. I love the textures, but I especially like the warm tone, subdued colors, and dappled light. And I like the imperfection of the moth in this instance. The shot is beautifully balanced. Excellent work of art.</td>', 'This is the sort of image I could hang on my wall, in very large format, and never get tired of looking at it. I love the textures, but I especially like the warm tone, subdued colors, and dappled light. And I like the imperfection of the moth in this instance. The shot is beautifully balanced. Excellent work of art.', '2007-08-27 11:58:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4032430, 571858, 65319, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on an outstanding BLUE.  Woooo Hoooo!!!</td>', 'Congratulations on an outstanding BLUE.  Woooo Hoooo!!!', '2007-08-27 11:59:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4032443, 571858, 10390, '<td valign="top">Congrats, great image!</td>', 'Congrats, great image!', '2007-08-27 12:10:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4032444, 572573, 70265, '<td valign="top">Tim,<br/> <br/>Didn''t recognize this as your little girl. Have been a fan of both your''s &amp; your wife''s work for awhile now. This one caught my eye and is absolutely wonderful! I love dreamy mystical shots like this, and the colors are beautiful as well ....</td>', 'Tim, Didn''t recognize this as your little girl. Have been a fan of both your''s & your wife''s work for awhile now. This one caught my eye and is absolutely wonderful! I love dreamy mystical shots like this, and the colors are beautiful as well ....', '2007-08-27 12:14:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4032490, 570894, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice strong use of primary colors and simple composition. The texture of the pavement, wall, and water give all this negative space interest. I like the way the guardrail and the direction of the bird''s flight lead to the seated individual. I think the two shadows on the left are distracting and clutter the image a bit. Other than that I think it''s excellent.</td>', 'Nice strong use of primary colors and simple composition. The texture of the pavement, wall, and water give all this negative space interest. I like the way the guardrail and the direction of the bird''s flight lead to the seated individual. I think the two shadows on the left are distracting and clutter the image a bit. Other than that I think it''s excellent.', '2007-08-27 12:44:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4032496, 573866, 61559, '<td valign="top">Wow! Should have been Top 10 :) Great pic!</td>', 'Wow! Should have been Top 10 :) Great pic!', '2007-08-27 12:49:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4032506, 574277, 29011, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on this inspiring and motivational shot. Made my top5 :)<br/></td>', 'Congratulations on this inspiring and motivational shot. Made my top5 :)', '2007-08-27 12:55:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4032513, 573449, 66384, '<td valign="top">I love the focus on this, the DOF, and the softness of the b&amp;w conversion. I don''t know how you got the bee so sharp and the flower so soft, but I love the effect. The contrast highlights the wings nicely. I enjoy the furry little body too. Even though I think the b&amp;w conversion is excellent, I miss the color in this image.</td>', 'I love the focus on this, the DOF, and the softness of the b&w conversion. I don''t know how you got the bee so sharp and the flower so soft, but I love the effect. The contrast highlights the wings nicely. I enjoy the furry little body too. Even though I think the b&w conversion is excellent, I miss the color in this image.', '2007-08-27 12:57:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4032514, 571858, 29011, '<td valign="top">woohoo!! So glad for you. Congratulations Sandy! :)<br/>This is a wonderfully elegant photo. Love how well the title works with this blue ribbon shot. Very appropriate.</td>', 'woohoo!! So glad for you. Congratulations Sandy! :)This is a wonderfully elegant photo. Love how well the title works with this blue ribbon shot. Very appropriate.', '2007-08-27 12:57:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4032521, 573218, 29011, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the ribbon and on beating your personal avg yet again :) I''m in awe of the design and symmetry of the wings. Great capture.</td>', 'Congratulations on the ribbon and on beating your personal avg yet again :) I''m in awe of the design and symmetry of the wings. Great capture.', '2007-08-27 12:58:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4032530, 574183, 29011, '<td valign="top">This was my favorite dragonfly shot of the challenge and my top5 list from this challenge. I was hoping to get a dragonfly shot and imagined it being just like this one, perspective wise. The colors are wonderful here. Still yet to take a dragonfly shot this year, it''s been a busy summer. Congratulations on making the top10 :)</td>', 'This was my favorite dragonfly shot of the challenge and my top5 list from this challenge. I was hoping to get a dragonfly shot and imagined it being just like this one, perspective wise. The colors are wonderful here. Still yet to take a dragonfly shot this year, it''s been a busy summer. Congratulations on making the top10 :)', '2007-08-27 13:01:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4032533, 573829, 29011, '<td valign="top">..Indeed it is! You''ve captued the grace and elegance of this wonderful creature. Excellent composition and timing :) <br/>Glad this made the top10.</td>', '..Indeed it is! You''ve captued the grace and elegance of this wonderful creature. Excellent composition and timing :) Glad this made the top10.', '2007-08-27 13:02:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4032562, 573492, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice image, and excellent title. It draws my attention to the position of the wings: one giving a peek at the body while the other keeps the butt covered. :) I have a little trouble distinguishing the subject from the background. I would like to see the color version of this. I am thinking that partial desaturation might be effective -- reducing the saturation of the background to almost B&amp;W while maintaining or even boosting the colors in the bird. I like the light on the feathers.</td>', 'Nice image, and excellent title. It draws my attention to the position of the wings: one giving a peek at the body while the other keeps the butt covered. :) I have a little trouble distinguishing the subject from the background. I would like to see the color version of this. I am thinking that partial desaturation might be effective -- reducing the saturation of the background to almost B&W while maintaining or even boosting the colors in the bird. I like the light on the feathers.', '2007-08-27 13:13:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4032572, 571858, 54885, '<td valign="top">You deserved this blue ribbon! Excellent capture and photo</td>', 'You deserved this blue ribbon! Excellent capture and photo', '2007-08-27 13:19:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4032592, 571858, 43774, '<td valign="top">I had a feeling this was yours when I saw it in voting....congratulations!!!!!</td>', 'I had a feeling this was yours when I saw it in voting....congratulations!!!!!', '2007-08-27 13:24:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4032594, 571814, 12253, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot!  I so want to shoot hummingbirds, but when I put a feeder out back, I didn''t manage to attract anything but bees.  Congratulations on this beautiful capture and 4th place!</td>', 'This is a great shot!  I so want to shoot hummingbirds, but when I put a feeder out back, I didn''t manage to attract anything but bees.  Congratulations on this beautiful capture and 4th place!', '2007-08-27 13:25:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4032669, 571858, 30214, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot Sandy, congratulations! <br/> <br/>is it the same model as in you "S" shot? Do you have her number? :)</td>', 'Beautiful shot Sandy, congratulations!  is it the same model as in you "S" shot? Do you have her number? :)', '2007-08-27 13:59:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4032688, 573218, 714, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture!  One thing that bugs me is the crop..why the crop to the side?</td>', 'Beautiful picture!  One thing that bugs me is the crop..why the crop to the side?', '2007-08-27 14:06:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4032690, 571858, 714, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture!</td>', 'Awesome capture!', '2007-08-27 14:06:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4032747, 573218, 20608, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Sonifo:</b></div><hr/><i> Beautiful picture!  One thing that bugs me is the crop..why the crop to the side? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks.. I tried it center but it just did not look right to me, this was the better crop as I think it gives the swan a place to go to, a space to move into... Just my personal feeling.</td>', 'Originally posted by Sonifo: Beautiful picture!  One thing that bugs me is the crop..why the crop to the side?   Thanks.. I tried it center but it just did not look right to me, this was the better crop as I think it gives the swan a place to go to, a space to move into... Just my personal feeling.', '2007-08-27 14:31:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4032764, 571858, 53892, '<td valign="top">oh my gosh--absolutely gorgeous!</td>', 'oh my gosh--absolutely gorgeous!', '2007-08-27 14:38:00.000000', NULL, 0),
