(4040694, 573891, 76430, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments everyone, especially the detailed one from <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=61818" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">routerguy666</a>.  My score was a real reality check, especially the 3.5 from commenters, but I appreciate the comments and have learned a lot and hope to continue to improve.  I''m trying to learn PS and tried a few things on this I hadn''t done before attempting to improve it.  Maybe I overdid the saturation, but it did make it more like <a href="//www.sandiegozoo.org/animalbytes/t-lorikeet.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Lorikeets </a> really look in good light.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments everyone, especially the detailed one from  routerguy666.  My score was a real reality check, especially the 3.5 from commenters, but I appreciate the comments and have learned a lot and hope to continue to improve.  I''m trying to learn PS and tried a few things on this I hadn''t done before attempting to improve it.  Maybe I overdid the saturation, but it did make it more like Lorikeets  really look in good light.', '2007-08-30 01:59:52.000000', NULL, 0),
