(4042197, 574277, 29904, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photography!  I so appreciate seeing a glider in this challenge since we call the apparatus a wing, and you got it a ribbon!  I wanted to go out and get some shots of my fellow paragliders or hanggies, but there is no action this time of the year.  You warmed my heart, thanks.</td>', 'Beautiful photography!  I so appreciate seeing a glider in this challenge since we call the apparatus a wing, and you got it a ribbon!  I wanted to go out and get some shots of my fellow paragliders or hanggies, but there is no action this time of the year.  You warmed my heart, thanks.', '2007-08-30 17:47:30.000000', NULL, 0),
