(4052039, 571676, 61552, '<td valign="top">Technically not wings?<br/> <br/>Each rotor is an airfoil.  A propellor is an airfoil.  A wing is an airfoil.<br/> <br/>Sorry, helo rotors are wings, even though they rotate.</td>', 'Technically not wings? Each rotor is an airfoil.  A propellor is an airfoil.  A wing is an airfoil. Sorry, helo rotors are wings, even though they rotate.', '2007-09-03 03:20:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4052274, 571754, 31637, '<td valign="top">Nice texture on the wings.</td>', 'Nice texture on the wings.', '2007-09-03 05:47:28.000000', NULL, 0),
