(4896321, 573787, 34659, '<td valign="top">In retrospect, I would have given this a 10.  You introduced me to these magfnicently beautiful birds with this terrific shot.  I love the colors, POV, focus/DOF, and composition.  This is one of those images that just haunts me (and has continued to do so since the challenge).  I remember it vividly at all times.  I''m not sure what else can be said to express my impression of this shot.  I love it.</td>', 'In retrospect, I would have given this a 10.  You introduced me to these magfnicently beautiful birds with this terrific shot.  I love the colors, POV, focus/DOF, and composition.  This is one of those images that just haunts me (and has continued to do so since the challenge).  I remember it vividly at all times.  I''m not sure what else can be said to express my impression of this shot.  I love it.', '2008-08-18 22:07:07.000000', NULL, 0),
